DreamGUISettings:bFieldTextCorrection {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGUISettings.h#DreamGUISettings:bFieldTextCorrection
    src   "Run the face of distance-field text above SmallTextMaxPixelSize through the same coverage correction small text gets\n(the contrast and the linear-light blend), so its weight does not jump at the cut-off. Off by default until measured\nagainst Chrome. Drawn by the shaders: the canvases pass it with the font atlas's geometry (FontAtlasInfo.z negated)."
    text  "让大于SmallTextMaxPixelSize的距离场文字表面经过与小字号文本相同的覆盖校正\n（对比度和线性光混合），使其字重在截断处不会突变。默认关闭，待与Chrome对比测量后再定。\n由着色器绘制：各画布随字体图集的几何数据一同传入（FontAtlasInfo.z取负）。"
    state machine
}

