    src   "Hide the cursor while a player uses a pad, and show it again on the mouse -- where DreamGUI is what shows it (its UI-only input mode)."
    text  "Hide the cursor while a player uses a pad, and show it again on the mouse -- where DreamGUI is what shows it (its UI-only input mode)."
    state machine
