DreamGUISettings:bTabWrapsAtScreenEnd {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGUISettings.h#DreamGUISettings:bTabWrapsAtScreenEnd
    src   "At the last control of a player's screen Tab goes round to the first, and Shift+Tab the other way. Popups and dialogs always go round."
    text  "在玩家屏幕的最后一个控件上，Tab 会绕回第一个，Shift+Tab 则反向绕回。弹出窗口和对话框始终绕回。"
    state machine
