DreamGUISettings:bUsePlatformAcceptBack {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGUISettings.h#DreamGUISettings:bUsePlatformAcceptBack
    src   "The pad's confirm and Back are the platform's own (FPlatformInput::GetGamepadAcceptKey and GetGamepadBackKey, which a\nSwitch swaps): they are added to ConfirmKeys and BackKeys when the game runs, and a face button listed there that\nthe platform uses the other way is left out. Off: the tables as they are."
    text  "手柄的确认和返回使用平台自身的按键（FPlatformInput::GetGamepadAcceptKey和GetGamepadBackKey，Switch会互换）：\n游戏运行时它们被加入ConfirmKeys和BackKeys，表中列出但平台反向使用的面键则被排除。\n关闭：表保持原样。"
    state machine
}

DreamGUISettings:bUseSlateInputSource {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGUISettings.h#DreamGUISettings:bUseSlateInputSource
    src   "Hear input from Slate itself -- an input pre-processor, ahead of the game viewport -- instead of through the\npreset actor's bindings on the player controller. DreamGUI then answers in every input mode, the engine's own\nUI-only mode included, where the viewport ignores input and the controller hears nothing; and it can keep what\nit handled from the game (SlateInputConsumePolicy). The preset actors stand down while it is on. Off for now;\nit becomes the default in a later version."
    text  "直接从Slate自身听取输入——作为输入预处理器，位于游戏视口之前——而不是通过\n预设Actor在玩家控制器上的绑定。这样DreamGUI能在所有输入模式下响应，包括引擎自带的\n仅UI模式（该模式下视口忽略输入，控制器什么也听不到）；并且它可以把已处理的输入\n拦下不传给游戏（SlateInputConsumePolicy）。开启时预设Actor会停用。目前关闭；\n后续版本中将成为默认值。"
    state machine
}

