DreamGUISettings:EffectPresets {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGUISettings.h#DreamGUISettings:EffectPresets
    src   "Effect settings kept as text, by name: an effect's node, `Glass { Refraction = 18  Frost = 0.25 }`, or a behaviour's\nline, `+ DreamMeshModifierWarp { Style = Arc  Bend = 60 }`. Applied from the designer's preset library to a widget of\nthat effect (or, for a behaviour, any widget), they set the values they name and leave the others."
    text  "以文本按名称保存的效果设置：效果节点，如`Glass { Refraction = 18  Frost = 0.25 }`，或行为的行，\n如`+ DreamMeshModifierWarp { Style = Arc  Bend = 60 }`。从设计器的预设库应用到该效果的控件（对于行为，\n则应用到任意控件）时，它们只设置所指名的值，其余保持不变。"
    state machine
}

DreamGUISettings:EventSystemActorClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGUISettings.h#DreamGUISettings:EventSystemActorClass
    src   "Spawned when a UI needs an event system and the level has none.\n\nA class rather than an asset because it is spawned: point it at the C++ preset, at one of the\npreset Blueprints, or at a project's own actor.\n\nThe only actor class DreamGUI still takes from a project. Root actors and pointer-source\nactors used to be named here too, one Blueprint per render mode; a world-space widget is an\nADreamWorldWidgetActor today and its raycaster is put on a transient per-player host with no\nclass to choose, so neither is a setting any more."
    text  "当UI需要事件系统而关卡中没有时生成。\n\n使用类而不是资产，是因为它需要被生成：可以指向C++预设、某个预设蓝图，\n或项目自己的Actor。\n\n这是DreamGUI仍从项目获取的唯一Actor类。根Actor和指针源Actor以前也\n在这里指定，每种渲染模式一个蓝图；如今世界空间控件是ADreamWorldWidgetActor，\n其射线检测器被放在每玩家临时的宿主上，没有类可供选择，\n因此这两者都不再是设置项。"
    state machine
}

