DreamGUISettings:SmallTextContrast {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGUISettings.h#DreamGUISettings:SmallTextContrast
    src   "Skia's text contrast for coverage glyphs: how much the coverage of light-on-dark and dark-on-light text is boosted\nbefore it is blended, 1.0 as Chromium ships it. 0 blends the raw coverage, as Slate does. Below 16: it shares a\nvertex channel with a flag (DreamTextQuadCode::CoverageLinearTarget)."
