    src   "How small text with effects (outline, glow, underlay) draws from coverage glyphs (UDreamGUISettings::bSmallTextCoverage):\nthe effects always come from the distance field, moved by the coverage face's snap so the two line up; this says what\nthe face is drawn from. Face softness and dilation keep a text on the field whatever this says."
    text  "带效果（描边、发光、衬底）的小号文本如何从覆盖率字形绘制（UDreamGUISettings::bSmallTextCoverage）：\n效果始终来自距离场，并按覆盖率字形面的对齐偏移移动，使两者对齐；此项说明\n字形面依据什么绘制。无论此项如何设置，字形面的柔和度与膨胀都会让文本保持在距离场上。"
    state machine
}

